e by agents over API and CLI.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T06:59:55.729-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Workflow Automation / Knowledge Management\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fusedframes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ml-intern\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ml-intern\",\n      \"description\": \"Hugging Face's open-source AI agent that fully automates ML post-training. Reads arXiv papers, fixes and creates datasets, runs training jobs, debugs failures, and iterates autonomously. Achieved +22 pts on GPQA in 10 hours and +60% on HealthBench. Available as CLI and web app.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T05:13:34.040-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Coding Agent / ML Research Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ml-intern\",\n        \"https://github.com/trending\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"KOS Protocol\",\n      \"url\": \"https://kosprotocol.dev\",\n      \"description\": \"A kos.json file standard for AI agents to read verified facts. Protocol for providing structured, verified information to AI agents, launched on Hacker News Show HN.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-24\",\n      \"category\": \"Developer Tool / Agent Infrastructure\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://news.ycombinator.com/newest\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"StarSinger MCP\",\n      \"url\": \"https://starsinger.ai\",\n      \"description\": \"Described as 'The Spotify for AI Agents' - an MCP (Model Context Protocol) tool for managing and integrating AI agents, launched on Hacker News Show HN.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-24\",\n      \"category\": \"Agent Infrastructure / MCP Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://news.ycombinator.com/newest\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Wrangle (Legacy)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wrangle\",\n      \"description\"