at enables chatting with local AI coding agents (including Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI) from any instant messaging app or browser terminal. Bridges local CLI agents with popular communication platforms.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-04-21\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"FusedFrames\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fusedframes\",\n    \"description\": \"macOS application that captures team expertise to power AI agents. Uses AI to interpret actions in real-time, detect decisions requiring explanation, and distills them into structured patterns with triggers, steps, reasoning, and outcomes.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-04-21\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Seeknal\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/seeknal\",\n    \"description\": \"All-in-one CLI for data & AI/ML engineering. Define pipelines in YAML/Python, run safe workflows, materialize data to PostgreSQL and Iceberg, and query data in natural language.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-04-21\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Wrangle\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wrangle\",\n    \"description\": \"Markdown editor that specifically understands and supports CLAUDE.md documentation format. Helps developers work with Claude Code's documentation structure more effectively.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-04-21\",\n    \"category\": \"IDE-integrated tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"EOL Dataset\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/eol-dataset\",\n    \"description\": \"Free tool to find every end-of-life dependency in your software stack in under